---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Services - Sinewy Electrical Solutions" description="Professional electrical services including substation installation, transmission & distribution, and industrial electrification">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>OUR SERVICES</h1>
      <p>COMPREHENSIVE ELECTRICAL SOLUTIONS FOR INDUSTRIAL & INFRASTRUCTURE PROJECTS</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container services-page">
    <section style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      <h2 class="section-title">SERVICES</h2>
      <div class="services-reference-block">
        <ul class="services-reference-list">
          <li>All kind of HT & LT Electrical Installation work.</li>
          <li>Industrial & Commercial Electrical work.</li>
          <li>Lay out, Residential and MS Building Electrical work.</li>
          <li>All BESCOM Power sanctions Approvals.</li>
          <li>CEIG Drawing Preparation and Approvals.</li>
          <li>All Electrical equipments Testing and Commissioning.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="services-reference-quote">“WORK IS WORSHIP, SERVICE IS JOY”</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="section-title">OUR SERVICE PORTFOLIO</h2>

      <div class="service-strip-list">
        <article class="service-strip-card">
          <div class="service-strip-content">
            <h3>HT ( High Tension )- 11 KV</h3>
            <ul class="service-point-list">
              <li>Installations of RCC poles, RSJ/11 Mts long spun poles with GOS, HORN GAP Fuse cross arms, insulators, guy sets, conductor, stringing of conductors, chain link fencing, complete as required by E.B.</li>
              <li>Installation of double pole structure with metering cubicle.</li>
              <li>Installation of HT metering cubicle with or without incoming isolator.</li>
              <li>Incoming isolator Ring mains unit (RMU) with loop in and out isolator and outgoing isolator with HRC fuse and HT metering cubicle and HT cabling.</li>
              <li>HRC fuse ring main unit with loop in isolator and outgoing 11kv breaker and HT metering cubicle total substation with distribution transformer.</li>
              <li>Installation of 11KV/433v Distribution Transformer indoor/outdoor with all required protection as required by E.B.</li>
              <li>Approvals: Inspection and Testing of HT Installation from Department of Electrical inspectorate.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="service-strip-media">
            <img src="/services/ht.jpeg" alt="HT ( High Tension )- 11 KV" class="service-strip-image" />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service-strip-card">
          <div class="service-strip-content">
            <h3>LT ( Low Tension )-11KV / 433V</h3>
            <ul class="service-point-list">
              <li>Installation of LT Panels, Motor control centres(MCC), Lighting panels and distribution of power system requirements.</li>
              <li>Capacitor panels automatic / manual as it is required from Electricity Supply Authority to maintain a power factor not less than 0.9.</li>
              <li>Approval, inspection and Testing of LT installation from Department of Electrical Inspectorate.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="service-strip-media">
            <img src="/services/lt.jpeg" alt="LT ( Low Tension )-11KV / 433V" class="service-strip-image" />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service-strip-card">
          <div class="service-strip-content">
            <h3>LT Bus ducts / Bus Trunking system and Cable Trays</h3>
            <p class="service-detail-placeholder">Supply, Erection, Testing and Commissioning of LT Bus ducts and Bus Trunking Systems</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-strip-media">
            <img src="/services/lt-busduct.jpeg" alt="LT Bus ducts / Bus Trunking system and Cable Trays" class="service-strip-image" />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service-strip-card">
          <div class="service-strip-content">
            <h3>HT/LT Panels & Distribution Boards</h3>
            <p class="service-detail-placeholder">Supply & installation of HT panels & Transformers</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-strip-media">
            <img src="/services/pan-distboard.jpeg" alt="HT/LT Panels & Distribution Boards" class="service-strip-image" />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service-strip-card">
          <div class="service-strip-content">
            <h3>Cabling and Wiring</h3>
            <ul class="service-point-list">
              <li>Medium Voltage distribution system at 3phase 4 wire 415v, 50Hz and single phase 2 wire 240v 50Hz AC supply.</li>
              <li>Installation of open / surface conduit system, Recessed conduit system. Conduits above fall ceiling PVC or MS conduits with all accessories like bends, collars, junction boxes, pull boxes etc.,</li>
              <li>LT cabling considering the maximum connected load, ambient temperature, grouping factor, allowances for voltage drops of PVC insulated, armoured laid in outdoor trenches, End terminated using brass single or double compression glands with copper/aluminium lugs including testing and commissioning as per IS-1554.</li>
              <li>Earthing electrodes as per IS-3043 compressing of Alu/Copper plate electrode and GI pipe electrode.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="service-strip-media">
            <img src="/services/cab-wir.jpeg" alt="Cabling and Wiring" class="service-strip-image" />
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service-strip-card">
          <div class="service-strip-content">
            <h3>Diesel Power Generation</h3>
            <ul class="service-point-list">
              <li>D.G.sets: Installation, Testing and commissioning of DG sets with sizing, ventilation system and earthing with all safety standards.</li>
              <li>Obtaining necessary approval from Electrical Inspectorate.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="service-strip-media">
            <img src="/services/dies-pg.jpeg" alt="Diesel Power Generation" class="service-strip-image" />
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top: 4rem;">
      <h2 class="section-title">ADDITIONAL SERVICES</h2>

      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Maintenance & Testing</h3>
          <p>Regular maintenance programs and comprehensive testing services to ensure optimal performance and safety of electrical systems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Emergency Services</h3>
          <p>24/7 emergency electrical services for critical situations requiring immediate professional attention and rapid deployment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Consultation & Design</h3>
          <p>Expert engineering consultation and system design services to optimize your electrical infrastructure for efficiency and safety.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Compliance & Certification</h3>
          <p>Full support for regulatory compliance, safety certifications, and adherence to all local electrical codes and standards.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Project Management</h3>
          <p>End-to-end project management services ensuring timely delivery, budget compliance, and quality assurance throughout execution.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Training & Support</h3>
          <p>Comprehensive training programs and ongoing technical support for facility operators and maintenance teams.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top: 4rem; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
      <h2 class="section-title">WHY CHOOSE OUR SERVICES</h2>

      <div class="services-why-grid">
        <div class="services-why-card">
          <div class="services-why-icon">✓</div>
          <h3>Licensed & Insured</h3>
          <p>All work performed by fully licensed professionals with comprehensive insurance coverage.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="services-why-card">
          <div class="services-why-icon">🛡️</div>
          <h3>Safety First</h3>
          <p>Strict adherence to all safety standards and regulations with comprehensive safety protocols.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="services-why-card">
          <div class="services-why-icon">⏱️</div>
          <h3>Timely Delivery</h3>
          <p>Efficient project management ensuring on-schedule completion without compromising quality.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <style>
    .services-page .service-strip-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.6rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 230px;
      align-items: start;
      gap: 1.1rem;
      position: relative;
      padding: 1.35rem 1.9rem 1.35rem 2.8rem;
      background: transparent;
      isolation: isolate;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: transform 0.25s ease, filter 0.25s ease;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      filter: saturate(1.03);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fbff 0%, #edf2f7 100%);
      clip-path: polygon(4.5% 0, 100% 0, 95.5% 100%, 0 100%);
      box-shadow:
        inset 0 0 0 2.8px #2b4667,
        inset 0 0 0 4.2px rgba(242, 163, 26, 0.2),
        inset 0 2px 0 rgba(242, 163, 26, 0.95),
        inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(242, 163, 26, 0.95),
        0 8px 16px rgba(26, 45, 69, 0.18);
      z-index: -1;
      transition: box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:hover::before {
      box-shadow:
        inset 0 0 0 2.8px #2b4667,
        inset 0 0 0 4.2px rgba(242, 163, 26, 0.28),
        inset 0 2px 0 rgba(242, 163, 26, 1),
        inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(242, 163, 26, 1),
        0 12px 24px rgba(26, 45, 69, 0.24);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: auto -5px -6px 5px;
      height: 100%;
      background: rgba(35, 63, 94, 0.4);
      clip-path: polygon(4.5% 0, 100% 0, 95.5% 100%, 0 100%);
      z-index: -2;
      filter: none;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(even) {
      grid-template-columns: 230px 1fr;
      padding: 1.35rem 2.8rem 1.35rem 1.9rem;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(even)::before {
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 95.5% 0, 100% 100%, 4.5% 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(even)::after {
      inset: auto 5px -6px -5px;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 95.5% 0, 100% 100%, 4.5% 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(even) .service-strip-content {
      order: 2;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(even) .service-strip-media {
      order: 1;
      justify-self: start;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 80% 0, 100% 100%, 20% 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      padding: 0.15rem 1.45rem 0.15rem 0.35rem;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(even) .service-strip-content {
      padding: 0.15rem 0.35rem 0.15rem 1.45rem;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-content h3 {
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-size: 1.12rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.35px;
    }

    .services-page .service-detail-placeholder {
      color: #4b5080;
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .services-page .service-point-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.28rem;
    }

    .services-page .service-point-list li {
      color: #4b5080;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
      font-weight: 500;
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 1rem;
      word-break: break-word;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .services-page .service-point-list li::before {
      content: '➤';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      top: 0.1rem;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-media {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0c4b83, #2c628f);
      border: 2px solid rgba(233, 187, 78, 0.9);
      border-radius: 0;
      width: 220px;
      height: 140px;
      padding: 0.55rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      justify-self: end;
      clip-path: polygon(20% 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 0 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(32, 52, 75, 0.25);
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:hover .service-strip-media {
      transform: scale(1.02);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 18px rgba(32, 52, 75, 0.32);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:first-child {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 300px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:first-child .service-strip-media {
      width: 300px;
      height: auto;
      min-height: 100%;
      align-self: stretch;
      padding: 0;
      clip-path: polygon(20% 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 0 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:first-child .service-strip-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      clip-path: polygon(20% 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 0 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(2) {
      grid-template-columns: 280px minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(2) .service-strip-media {
      width: 280px;
      height: auto;
      min-height: 100%;
      align-self: stretch;
      padding: 0;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 80% 0, 100% 100%, 20% 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(2) .service-strip-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 80% 0, 100% 100%, 20% 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(3) {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 280px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(3) .service-strip-media {
      width: 280px;
      height: auto;
      min-height: 100%;
      align-self: stretch;
      padding: 0;
      clip-path: polygon(20% 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 0 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(3) .service-strip-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      clip-path: polygon(20% 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 0 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(4) {
      grid-template-columns: 280px minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(4) .service-strip-media {
      width: 280px;
      height: auto;
      min-height: 100%;
      align-self: stretch;
      padding: 0;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 80% 0, 100% 100%, 20% 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(4) .service-strip-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 80% 0, 100% 100%, 20% 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(5) {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 300px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(5) .service-strip-media {
      width: 300px;
      height: auto;
      min-height: 100%;
      align-self: stretch;
      padding: 0;
      clip-path: polygon(20% 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 0 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(5) .service-strip-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      clip-path: polygon(20% 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 0 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(6) {
      grid-template-columns: 300px minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(6) .service-strip-media {
      width: 300px;
      height: auto;
      min-height: 100%;
      align-self: stretch;
      padding: 0;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 80% 0, 100% 100%, 20% 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(6) .service-strip-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 80% 0, 100% 100%, 20% 100%);
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      clip-path: inherit;
      transition: transform 0.25s ease;
    }

    .services-page .service-strip-card:hover .service-strip-image {
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }

    .services-page .service-placeholder {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.18rem;
      color: var(--white);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.45rem;
    }

    .services-page .placeholder-icon {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .services-page .service-placeholder span {
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .services-page .service-placeholder small {
      font-size: 0.52rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
      word-break: break-all;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .services-page .services-why-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .services-page .services-why-card {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      background: var(--light-gray);
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .services-page .services-why-icon {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: var(--secondary-orange);
    }

    .services-page .services-why-card h3 {
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .services-page .services-why-card p {
      color: var(--text-light);
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .services-page .service-strip-card,
      .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(even) {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding: 1rem;
      }

      .services-page .service-strip-card:first-child,
      .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(2),
      .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(3),
      .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(4),
      .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(5),
      .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(6) {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .services-page .service-strip-card::before {
        clip-path: none;
        border-radius: 10px;
      }

      .services-page .service-strip-card::after {
        display: none;
      }

      .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(even) .service-strip-content,
      .services-page .service-strip-card:nth-child(even) .service-strip-media {
        order: initial;
      }

      .services-page .service-strip-list .service-strip-card .service-strip-content {
        padding: 0;
      }

      .services-page .service-strip-list .service-strip-card .service-strip-media {
        width: 100%;
        height: 190px;
        min-height: 0;
        align-self: auto;
        padding: 0;
        clip-path: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
        justify-self: stretch;
      }

      .services-page .service-strip-list .service-strip-card .service-strip-image {
        clip-path: none;
      }

      .services-page .services-why-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .services-page .services-why-card {
        padding: 1.25rem;
      }
    }

    .services-page .service-list li {
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .services-page .service-list li::before {
      content: none;
    }

    .services-page .services-reference-list li {
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .services-page .services-reference-list li::before {
      content: none;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
